diff --git a/news/schemaless-documents b/news/schemaless-documents
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f9fa4b3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/news/schemaless-documents
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+### Enhancements
+
+* Documents without a `$schema` key are no longer validated by
+  `menuinst._schema.validate`, which now returns `None` for them. This mirrors
+  conda-build's behaviour and lets a document opt out of validation when it
+  targets an unpublished schema revision.
+
+### Bug fixes
+
+* A menuinst v2 document that omits `$schema` is no longer misrouted to the
+  v1 installer. Version dispatch now falls back to the presence of the v2-only
+  `platforms` key instead of relying on `$schema`/`$id` alone.
+
+### Deprecations
+
+* <news item>
+
+### Docs
+
+* <news item>
+
+### Other
+
+* <news item>
